WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.259 --> 00:00:10.268
1. Choose a service
Choose the care you need from the service icons

2
00:00:10.268 --> 00:00:18.271
2. City and date
Select your city and date, then choose “Search”

3
00:00:18.271 --> 00:00:27.272
3. Your account and verified email
Register with a country-coded mobile number, confirm your email and sign in

4
00:00:27.272 --> 00:00:35.272
4. Choose a salon service
Open the salon, check the service and choose “Continue”

5
00:00:35.272 --> 00:00:43.272
5. Professional, date and time
The times shown are available. Choose one that suits you

6
00:00:43.272 --> 00:00:52.275
6. Your saved mobile and booking details
Your mobile comes from your account automatically. Change it only in profile settings

7
00:00:52.275 --> 00:01:00.274
7. Confirm and pay at the salon
The booking appears in the salon’s calendar. No card is needed in Eneres

8
00:01:00.274 --> 00:01:08.276
8. Your appointments in one place
View your booking. Changes and cancellations follow the salon’s deadline
